{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "b59211b8061d233c3ece9197b0a156ab15c36ce8603f9dcdc38fbdbf0544f20f", "ja": "～火星人襲来？～", "zh": "～火星人来袭？～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a7752cd66bd4d7070636a71c40e1c94dfc3764b1b6deeaf5db16c080e55030a0", "ja": "会場の下見を終えた歌織、美希、紬、\n百合子。昨日読んだ本のおかげで、\n火星人の襲来におびえる百合子のために、\nみんなは明日の本番に備えて、\nもう少しレッスンをしていくことにする。", "zh": "结束会场下见的歌织、美希、紬、\n百合子。多亏了昨天读的书，\n百合子害怕火星人来袭，\n为了明天的正式演出，\n大家决定再多练习一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1000_052kao", "source_sha256": "a9400654dc1e2951a9bd4ce8ff396c1918d82f88ff773e297d80a533f825f495", "ja": "そろそろ、私達の時間はおしまいね。\nみんな、会場の下見はこれくらいにして、戻りましょ。", "zh": "我们的时间也差不多要结束了呢。大家，场地也看得差不多了，我们回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "3baf445caed88d0d1857a5bcbaccf898b5de9e310c1e3f11805ce9375a7384f0", "ja": "あふぅ……。ミキ、もう眠たくなっちゃったの。\n帰って、のんびりお昼寝したいな。", "zh": "哈啊……美希已经困了呢。\n好想回去悠闲地睡个午觉啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "105f6f3b5307f4423a061225577cbfeef3d7592bf306326ad77b96fc7814ec79", "ja": "うらやましいです。私なんて、昨日は緊張で眠れなく\nて……。つい愛読書を読破したら、別の不安まで……。", "zh": "真羡慕你。我昨天可是紧张得根本睡不\n着……忍不住把爱看的书读完后，甚至还产生了别的担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c80cce9d0c1a131e10aa62e627def1d197c52eedf9bba831ab18e5b1aa8711f2", "ja": "七尾さんも眠れてないんですね……。\nあの、それで、別の不安とはどういったものでしょう？", "zh": "七尾小姐也没睡好吗……  \n那个，您说的另一个不安，具体是指什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "9197dfcc0788bbe867846cc1aa07bd36964f53b950617ec6b6f1125c68aaf854", "ja": "それが……もし本番中に火星人が襲来してきたらって\n考えたら……いてもたってもいられないんです！", "zh": "可是……一想到要是正式演出时火星人来袭……就坐立不安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "eecd948ebe4cc16927324165d56f38dbb686ebbb51d9b036988d4d3f6ca26055", "ja": "……ええっ！　火星人が襲来って……。\nあ、あの……そんなことがあるんでしょうか？", "zh": "……哎！火星人袭来什么的……\n那、那个……真的会有这种事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "3c08a18522080e26f42c0a38afaff39610a0bee7e15e4e3928148767a81aba1c", "ja": "ん～、なんだかよく分かんないけど、\nミキは、火星人なんてこないって思うな。", "zh": "嗯～虽然不太明白是怎么回事，但美希觉得火星人什么的不会来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "f0d15851078f0c30b1485f9aa200e8cba4fa6cb725d79904c7d28d45e268ded9", "ja": "そ、それは私も分かってるんですけど、\nでも万が一って思ったら……ああっ！", "zh": "我、我也知道这一点，可是想到万一……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "7e53658e3c1498ff7353841c3162fb0944d009039bbc198eed6857ad97ef7a41", "ja": "そ、そうね……。もし火星人が来ても、私達の\nファンにしちゃえばいいんじゃないかしら……？", "zh": "是、是啊……就算火星人来了，把他们也变成我们的粉丝不就好了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6130d5a4711fda03bbaa830c995416664791c68d2dfe6da4e0764a7fdad3c185", "ja": "そ、そうですよ、七尾さん。いいステージを見せ\nられれば！　その、私はまだ不安がありますが……。", "zh": "是、是啊，七尾小姐。只要能让大家看到精彩的舞台！不过，我还是有些不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "386c83e85c8118655e33078a414aa60dd046ad6360d1e8ede1a84b2de3e8f039", "ja": "ミキ達なら大丈夫だよ！　みんなレッスンでちゃんと\nできてたし。いつも通り頑張ればいいって思うな☆", "zh": "只要是美希她们就没问题！大家在练习时都表现得很好。照平时那样努力就行了，我觉得呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "e0d21a3769d37926be90d014de8b996f311be96e35d3cef100bbcd0ca7b0279c", "ja": "美希ちゃんの言う通りよ。でもまだ不安なら、もう少し\nレッスンしましょうか。明日に備えて眠れるように。", "zh": "美希说得没错。不过如果你还是不安，要不要再练习一会儿？这样也能为明天做好准备，安心睡个好觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "2f2b1aea145e472425b686d2d5b7923734bc93ecb4c6ef65679ef9bba7aed80c", "ja": "みんな、ミキ達のステージに来てくれてありがとう\nなの！　いーっぱい楽しんでいってね、あはっ☆", "zh": "大家，谢谢你们来美希她们的舞台！\n要尽情玩个痛快哦，啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1e4a42c99ac86204a51491e7c70d6f592d3bace4a8e32fff2f88465e55323d56", "ja": "記念すべき節目の時に恥じぬよう、精一杯鍛錬をつんで\n参りました。ご堪能頂ければ、幸いです。", "zh": "为了不辜负这值得纪念的时刻，我已竭尽全力、刻苦磨砺。希望您能尽情享受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "30d0a8300e13c1e4e6397d7b5ce2d5c6eea81a669d4ed5e7f93b29ca95a7ac15", "ja": "今日は、火星人もファンになっちゃうくらいの\nステキなステージをお届けします！", "zh": "今天要为大家带来精彩绝伦的舞台，精彩到连火星人都会成为粉丝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "e294caa451f1a3889c0c9e688d7d7a05ec9a6be80a64d1715cef5ef5c74afadd", "ja": "それじゃあ、歌います！\n成長した私達を、見てくださいね～♪", "zh": "那么，我们要开始唱歌了！\n请看看成长后的我们吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_02_1016_audience", "source_sha256": "d4a24de7732f4fc96422562f5cbf6af59494bc5a2eff23580ef50ef09e85feb2", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアアアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
